n unproved.\",\n        \"remaining\": [\n          \"Complete initial backbone: read vote granting and campaign producers, follower election triggers, persistence/restart reconstruction, snapshot recovery, membership contracts and actual FSM completion before declaring core_overview usable.\",\n          \"Investigate whether a legal leadership history and normal replication retry can deliver a matching bounded batch while a follower retains a divergent suffix below LeaderCommitIndex. Check producer nextIndex/backtracking, pipeline ordering and any alternate commitment protection before constructing a check.\",\n          \"Read storage error contracts and recovery for appendEntries truncation followed by StoreLogs failure; the source explicitly notes a stale last-log cache in that path, but fault applicability and consequences are unknown.\"\n        ],\n        \"understanding\": \"updated\",\n        \"rationale\": \"The commitment-object lifetime explains a potential old-reply concern without needing execution. The distinct producer/consumer bounds leave a more concrete safety question, grounded in the FSM contract but not yet a formal Candidate. Source reading is the next discriminator; no execution evidence has been produced.\",\n        \"question_updates\": {}\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"pending_work\": [],\n  \"current\": {\n    \"phase\": \"executed\",\n    \"operation_id\": \"4b52122f1efb42bab56011a077fc10b3\",\n    \"action\": \"research\"\n  },\n  \"latest_decision\": {\n    \"operation_id\": \"4b52122f1efb42bab56011a077fc10b3\",\n    \"action\": \"research\",\n    \"record\": {\n      \"path\": \"state.json\",\n      \"collection\": \"selections\",\n      \"match\": {\n        \"operation_id\": \"4b52122f1efb42bab56011a077fc10b3\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"stop\": {},\n  \"stop_reason\": \"Not started\",\n  \"explorations\": [],\n  \"review_issues\": [],\n  \"run_id\": \"7500cc3b1dac44179c0dfc4f0abf1177\",\n  \"snapshot_id\": \"32729be1ccc84557b934f19